WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
JobLens AI — Chrome extension for ATS-style job analysis on LinkedIn

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Upload your resume in PDF or DOCX format

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Resume text is parsed locally for privacy-friendly analysis

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Visit a LinkedIn job page and JobLens automatically detects the role

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Analyze ATS match score, matching skills, missing skills, and job requirements